
menu "IMU Tag"

config IMU_TAG_DEBUG_COUNTERS
        bool "Log the acquisition counters every 5 s"
        default n
        help
          Bench instrument for the measurements page. The stats item logs
          the FIFO margin counters, the newest sample and the comparison
          of the two burst time anchors every 5 s.

endmenu

source "Kconfig.zephyr"